@ codes, selected index, first visible row, labels, header label -> draws the
@ home view straight into PICT (ERASE clears it in place: no full-screen GROB
@ is built, which on a 48G with little free RAM is what brings collections).
@ Rows: 5 visible, 8 px each from y=12, the selected one inverted; codes at x=87.
\<< \-> codes sel top lbls hdr
  \<<
    ERASE
    PICT { #0d #0d } "TOTP" 2 \->GROB REPL
    hdr 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST PICT SWAP ROT REPL
    IF ACCTS SIZE 0 == THEN
      PICT "No accounts yet:" 20 CTXT
      PICT "press ADD" 30 CTXT
    ELSE
      top top 4 + ACCTS SIZE MIN FOR k
        #131d #8d BLANK
        { #2d #0d } ACCTS k GET 1 GET 2 \->GROB REPL
        { #87d #0d } codes k GET FMT7 2 \->GROB REPL
        IF k sel == THEN NEG END
        PICT SWAP k top - 8 * 12 + R\->B #0d SWAP 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
      NEXT
    END
    PICT { #0d #56d } lbls REPL
  \>>
\>>
